<%#
# Select Show Partial

Replaces the Administrate partial: when the options are [name, value] pairs
(the status and language of a clinic, the role of a member) the name of the
current value is shown instead of the raw value.

## Local variables:

- `field`: an `Administrate::Field::Select`.
%>
<% option = field.selectable_options.find { |candidate| candidate.is_a?(Array) && candidate.last.to_s == field.data.to_s } %>
<%= option ? option.first : field.data %>
